# Native account creation/login use the existing Sites D1 binding DB.
# No identity-provider keys, email service, or app-wide password secret required.
# Keep populated .env/.dev.vars files out of source control.

# Optional: encrypted messaging uses a separate trusted HTTPS Matrix origin.
# Leaving this unset does not prevent creating a Voidline account.
# MATRIX_HOMESERVER=https://matrix.example.com
